You have a free-model router at `http://127.0.0.1:8787/v1` (OpenAI-compatible).

## Before a task
- `hyperrouter models --task "<task>"` shows the best free models and why.
- `hyperrouter pick "<task>" --explain` shows the scoring breakdown for the winner.
- `hyperrouter prompt "<task>"` builds an enriched prompt.
